ent-WiredApronBase = 鋼絲圍裙 | wired apron
    .desc = 一條綴有編織線的圍裙。看起來似乎尚未完成。 | An apron threaded with cabling. It looks incomplete.
ent-SteelApronBase = 鋼製護裙 | steel-covered apron
    .desc = 一件用多餘電纜隨意固定的、帶有鋼板襯裡的圍裙。以目前的狀態而言，一旦穿上，它會立刻散架。 | An apron with steel plating haphazardly affixed by spare cabling. In it's current state, it would fall apart immediately if worn.
ent-WeldedSteelApronBase = 焊接鋼製圍裙 | welded steel apron
    .desc = 一件附有焊接鋼板的護甲，該鋼板固定在備用纜線上。這套護甲已不再有解體的危險，但仍需進行額外加工才能確保穿戴穩固。 | An apron affixed with welded steel plating attached to spare cabling. The armor is no longer in danger of falling apart, but requires additional work to be worn securely.
ent-ClothingOuterArmorScrap = 廢棄盔甲 | scrap armor
    .desc = 一名tider閃閃發光的板甲。站住，否則你死定了。 | A tider's gleaming plate mail. Bail up, or you're a dead man.
